    "detailed_description": "&quot;Solemn Knights: Entirely Ours Definitive Edition&quot;<br />\r\nis an engaging 2D turn-based RPG that takes players on a journey with Thelonius, a valiant knight of the kingdom of Astoria, who suddenly awakes in a completely unknown world. As Thelonius embarks on his adventure, players will experience a captivating story of mystery, loss, discovery, and friendship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThroughout the game, players will guide Thelonius on his path to unravel the secrets of this new realm and aid him in his quest to return home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith nostalgic driven visuals, classic turn-based gameplay, and a compelling story, &quot;Solemn Knights: Entirely Ours&quot; offers a captivating and thought provoking indie RPG experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you are a seasoned fan of the classics, or a newcomer to the genre, Solemn Knights: Entirely Ours is certain to grab your attention. Are you ready to embark on an epic adventure with Thelonius, and discover the secrets that lie ahead?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor more content, community resources and bug reports, please visit our discord.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttps://discord.gg/em7zkgT8c8",
